      {
        "method": "AdaIN",
        "url": "https://github.com/xunhuang1995/AdaIN-style",
        "finding": "Author implementation. Shared encoder/decoder convolutions plus input-style-dependent normalization demonstrate that per-reference kernel generation is not necessary for arbitrary style transfer."
