      {
        "method": "DIN",
        "url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/1911.06953",
        "finding": "Style encoder predicts dynamic convolution weight and bias; default kernel is1x1, with larger/spatial/deformable variants discussed. Author homepage links code viaOSF85rgu; code package not accessible in this research session."
